        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring that childhood feeling back — a small creature that depends on you, gently. Your <strong>desktop companion</strong> sits at the edge of the screen while you work, study, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It asks for simple care: food, water, bath, play, cleaning — and responds with tiny moods and animations that make everyday moments feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no heavy micromanagement: quick interactions, soothing vibes. As days pass, your pet <strong>grows</strong> and shows new behaviors. Leave it alone for too long, and it may <strong>get sick</strong> — or even <strong>pass away</strong>. The heart of the game is the bond you build: return, care, and watch happiness bloom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.mp4?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to daily care, you can also <strong>customize your companion and environment</strong> with adorable items that add even more charm and personality to your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you’ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real companionship:</strong> always there, never in the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle care loop:</strong> subtle reminders, quick actions, stress-free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based growth:</strong> evolving stages and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; cute:</strong> soft, comforting atmosphere for everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful stakes:</strong> your attention truly matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legal note</strong><br>*“<strong>Tamagotchi</strong>” is a trademark of Bandai. This game is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Bandai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTA</strong><br>Like it? <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to stay in the loop.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring that childhood feeling back — a small creature that depends on you, gently. Your <strong>desktop companion</strong> sits at the edge of the screen while you work, study, or game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It asks for simple care: food, water, bath, play, cleaning — and responds with tiny moods and animations that make everyday moments feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/47142b27a1732987fab5b1c57b233286.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no heavy micromanagement: quick interactions, soothing vibes. As days pass, your pet <strong>grows</strong> and shows new behaviors. Leave it alone for too long, and it may <strong>get sick</strong> — or even <strong>pass away</strong>. The heart of the game is the bond you build: return, care, and watch happiness bloom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/7b1193465c6f9321f9144fb84eb73816.mp4?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to daily care, you can also <strong>customize your companion and environment</strong> with adorable items that add even more charm and personality to your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.poster.avif?t=1758214817\" width=300 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964530/extras/e7c46bf2973cf2ab234b0283b03952c5.webm?t=1758214817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why you’ll love it</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real companionship:</strong> always there, never in the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle care loop:</strong> subtle reminders, quick actions, stress-free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-based growth:</strong> evolving stages and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy &amp; cute:</strong> soft, comforting atmosphere for everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful stakes:</strong> your attention truly matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legal note</strong><br>*“<strong>Tamagotchi</strong>” is a trademark of Bandai. This game is <strong>not</strong> affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by Bandai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CTA</strong><br>Like it? <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to stay in the loop.</p>",
